{
  "description": "tikajs-ibvq. Adapted from xberg (MIT) td/EPUB_EDGE_CASES.md + epub_hardening_tests.rs. Oracle Tika 4.2.0 /rmeta: an undeclared &nbsp; without a DOCTYPE ends that chapter at the entity (text 'First' kept, 'ENTITY-CHAPTER-ONE' after it is not read) as a TIKA-237 container exception; the next chapter is read. xberg expected both markers.",
  "tags": [
    "xberg",
    "epub",
    "edge"
  ],
  "input": {
    "base64": "",
    "filename": "a.epub"
  },
  "assertions": [
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "First"
    },
    {
      "type": "not_contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "ENTITY-CHAPTER-ONE"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "ENTITY-CHAPTER-TWO"
    }
  ]
}
